            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear colleagues, It has come to our attention that a significant number of employees have not as yet completed the mandatory online training module, which was required to be completed prior to the end of the previous month. In order to ensure compliance with company policy, it is requested that all outstanding modules be completed at the earliest possible convenience, and in the event that difficulties are experienced, assistance can be obtained from the IT department.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Leitura e explicação oral (6 min):",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " leia a sua versão em voz alta. Explique 3 mudanças ("
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "I changed “prior to” to “before” because…",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "). O professor lê a original em voz alta: qual é mais fácil de ouvir?"
